From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lusoris <lusoris@pm.me>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 20:18:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] avfilter: add the vmafx_pre filter on the VMAFx API

The vmaf_pre filter under its VMAFx name, with the same options, on the
library's vmafx_dnn_session_* functions. A failed inference fails the
frame naming the plane instead of copying the plane through. Built with
--enable-libvmafx.
---
 configure                  |   1 +
 doc/filters.texi           |  26 ++++
 libavfilter/Makefile       |   1 +
 libavfilter/allfilters.c   |   1 +
 libavfilter/vf_vmafx_pre.c | 265 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 294 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 libavfilter/vf_vmafx_pre.c

